    {
        "Id": 118,
        "ActionId": 118,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Bambinata trusts Mistress's decision. Mistress trusted 【kuroname】, so Bambinata should trust 【kuroname】 too."
